The ARC-Challenge test split is a set of grade-school science questions, each
multiple-choice, assembled by the Allen Institute for AI from a range of US
state exams and other sources. The HuggingFace dataset card records the licence
as CC BY-SA 4.0; the metadata section for licensing on that card itself reads
"[More Information Needed]", so the licence named above is the one declared in
the card's `license` field and the one applied here.

